      "ImageDescription": {
        "value": "Voided Specimen of a current type Finnish passport. Image of passport's front cover and bearer’s details page. \n<p>This type of passport is issued at Finnish Embassies and Diplomatic Representations abroad and is limited in validity to one year. Passports issued within Finland are valid for five years. This passport looks very similar to the type issued within Finland. Unlike current passports issued in Finland, passports issued abroad do not contain a contactless chip. \n</p>\nThe image of the bearer shown in this passport is a photo of myself.",
        "source": "commons-desc-page"
